Explain type-switches on the strconv.Atoi error: for *strconv.NumError it returns the
field e.Err, the default branch returns err. Expected: an Unresolved(memory) "load of
field Err of *strconv.NumError" and NO entry wrapped in *strconv.NumError.Unwrap (the
wrapper itself is never returned: ErrSyntax/ErrRange only hide behind the field). The
default branch may contribute the bare internal/strconv.Error over-approximation of
port_wrap_numerror, since those values are not *NumError.
-- args --
config/config.go:@explain
